Licensing scope

The specification, OpenAPI and JSON Schema definitions, conformance tests,
validation tools and their newly authored supporting files are licensed under
Apache-2.0. See LICENSES/Apache-2.0.txt and per-file SPDX identifiers.

The reference/ implementation is licensed under GPL-3.0-only.
See reference/LICENSE and LICENSES/GPL-3.0-only.txt.

No mandatory SDK is provided. Consumers can implement the Apache-2.0 contract
using their own HTTP client. The reference implementation is a separate program;
its implementation code is not part of the permissively licensed interface.

Standard license texts retain their original notices.
